ar \uc2  ZAMAN \par \par \uc2  - Economy Minister Kemal Dervis says the IMF, which is negotiating a new economic programme to replace its gutted $11.5 billion deal with \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 , cannot \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the country's domestic affairs. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010713dx4a02dmo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
