\par\par \b \uc2  Turkish lira weakens vs dlr, c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 September 1999\par 15:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL, Sept 10 (Reuters) - The Turkish lira closed weaker against the dollar due to a lower euro/dollar parity and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's lira sales for dollars in late trade, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dollar purchases caused banks' offer rates for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rise to 451,450 lira from around 451,300 previously. \par \par \uc2  This was the eighth consecutive trading day the bank acted to defend its lira depreciation target which compensates for \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's high inflation. \par \par \uc2  Following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the lira ended at 450,900/451,350 per dollar, easier than 449,450/950 at Thursday's close. \par \par \uc2  The daily lira depreciation against a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket of one dollar and 0.77 euro was unchanged at 0.130 percent, according to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official fixing rates of 449,076/451,242 for dollar/lira and 472,922/475,203 for euro/lira. \par \par \uc2  Bankers estimate the bank's lira depreciation target to be around 3.6-3.7 percent this month. The lira lost 3.3 percent of its value in August when year-on-year wholesale price inflation was 3.3 percent. \par \par \uc2  Bankers said banks' late dollar sales followed volatility prompted mainly by euro/dollar movements earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  They said the dollar's strength in world markets fuelled the rise in dollar/lira rates despite banks' sales. ((Istanbul newsroom, 90 212-275 0875, fax 90 212-267 2137, istanbul.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv9a00uxe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
