\par\par \b \uc2  Turkish lira ends easier vs dlr, c.bank sells lira. \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 September 1999\par 15:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL, Sept 9 (Reuters) - The Turkish lira closed weaker against the dollar on Thursday, in line with a firmer U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in international markets, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold lira for dollars in late trade to guard its daily lira depreciation target in face of banks' persistent hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales, pushing up banks' dollar offer rates to around 450,000 lira from a previous 449,700. \par \par \uc2  This was the seventh consecutive trading day the bank acted to defend its lira depreciation target which compensates for \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2 's high inflation. \par \par \uc2  Following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the lira ended at 449,450/950 per dollar, easier than 448,100/350 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The daily lira depreciation against a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket of one dollar and 0.77 euro stood unchanged at 0.129 percent, according to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official fixing rates of 447,562/449,721 for lira/dollar and 473,521/475,805 for lira/euro. \par \par \uc2  Bankers estimate the bank's lira depreciation target to be around 3.6 percent this month. The lira lost 3.3 percent of its value in August when year-on-year wholesale price inflation was 3.3 percent. \par \par \uc2  Bankers said banks' dollar sales increased as they sought cash after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  injected only 39.5 trillion lira through its one-week repo auction, meeting only 19 percent of the bids. ((Istanbul newsroom, 90 212-275 0875, fax 90 212-267 2137, istanbul.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv9900xg4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
