\par\par \b \uc2  Turkey officials say no change in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  policy. \b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 1999\par 14:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  ANKARA, July 2 (Reuters) - Turkish economy officials said on Friday that ongoing talks with the International Monetary Fund would not bring any radical change in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  "There will be no change in our \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  head Gazi Ercel told a news conference jointly held with a visiting International Monetary Fund team. \par \par \uc2  Economy Minister Hikmet Ulugbay told the conference that a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board would not be part of any future arrangement between the IMF and Turkey. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been keeping the lira's depreciation rate on par with inflation as part of its monetary policy since 1995 through open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Carlo Cottarelli, head of the IMF's \b \highlight22\uc2 Turkey\b0 \highlight\uc2  desk, said earlier that a staff monitoring accord would remain in place as a bridge towards a new programme but did not give a time frame. \par \par \uc2  He said "strategic steps" must still be taken before putting a new programme into practice. \par \par \uc2  Turkish markets had been hoping for news of a new arragement including financial support, but Cottarelli did not mention any amounts. The IMF previously linked new funds to government progress on structural reforms in social security, banking and agriculture. \par \par \uc2  ((Istanbul newsroom, +90-212-275 0875, fax +90-212-267 2137, istanbul.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv72058cl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
