\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Turkey \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk -2: Further  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juni 1999\par 11:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  ISTANBUL (Dow Jones)--Commercial banks' dollar selling for lira triggered a Turkish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Tuesday's morning session, with the bank selling Turkish lira (TRL) for dollars. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came when the dollar/euro rate was changing fast and local banks weren't able to adjust their lira prices accordingly. \par \par \uc2  An Istanbul-based trader estimated that with the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the bank may have reaped about $20 million. \par \par \uc2  Another trader said a morning \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might be a sign of a faster lira depreciation and that afternoon trading needs to be seen. \par \par \uc2  Traders see further bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  Around 0850 GMT dollar offers were at TRL414,050, up from early Tuesday's TRL413,350. \par \par \uc2  The euro was at $1.0385, down from $1.0419 and $1.0423 late Monday in New York. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday fixed the lira at a monthly 3.25% lira depreciation against the dollar/euro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket. The rate is relatively slow, compared with the previous month's 3.5%. \par \par \uc2  The Turkish Treasury is also holding two auctions Tuesday to sell paper worth TRL900 trillion to TRL1.1 quadrillion and some of the commercial bank dollar selling is seen related to the auction. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's slower lira depreciation policy encourages fund inflow to lira instruments. \par \par \uc2  -By Selim Atalay; +90 212 231 3355; satalay@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 15-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0910GMT \par \par \uc2  1169 1862 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6f04hyv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
